# 000400-000499/20070608T062936Z_136777048.wiki
zΔ⚡b|=3a5a|+ It should be noted that the only really interesting value is the ''l'' line number of the first range; all the other values can be computed from the diff.|=955|+%0A%0AAs a special case, unified diff expects to work with files that end in a newline. If either file does not, unified diff will emit the special line%0A%0A \ No newline at end of file%0A%0Aafter the modifications. The [[patch]] program should be aware of this.|=b46|
